<title>INDIA: India's Tata Tea up two pct on BSE.</title>
<headline>India's Tata Tea up two pct on BSE.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Tata Tea gained 6.50 rupees, or two percent, to 323.75 on the Bombay bourse on Tuesday as investors bid on a global rally in tea prices, traders said.</p>
<p>Tata Tea shares have gained more than 10 percent on the Bombay bourse this week.  </p>
<p>The Economic Times newspaper said the recent spurt in the firm's stock price could be attributed to the speculative rise in auction prices of tea stocks.</p>
<p>The newspaper said there has been a 10 percent increase in tea prices in the domestic market.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
